o<touch_off_x> sub
    (Sets the X tool offset from a measured DIAMETER passed in as #1.)
    (G7 is asserted explicitly: the interpreter starts in G8, and every)
    (interpreter re-init puts it back there, so the mode cannot be assumed.)

    #<x_offset_touch_position> = #1
    #<was_diameter_mode> = #<_lathe_diameter_mode>

    G40 (cancel tool radius compensation)
    G7  (diameter mode)
    G10 L10 P #5400 X [#<x_offset_touch_position>]  (5400 = tool number)
    T #5400 G43 (enable tool length offset)

    o<restore_x_mode> if [#<was_diameter_mode> EQ 0]
        G8 (leave the mode as it was found)
    o<restore_x_mode> endif
o<touch_off_x> endsub

M2 (end program)
